  "captured_at": "2026-11-04",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "text": "Quokka is a mobile security and privacy solution. The Quokka stream retrieves findings data."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Prerequisites",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "To configure the Quokka connector, you need the source authentication configuration. The API key parameter is required. To enable and generate the API key:"
    },
    {
      "item": "Enable the API Key",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Log in to the Quokka platform as an admin.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "From the upper right of the page, click the account name and go to the account settings page.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "Select Group Admin.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          18
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Create a new user, or click the user you want to edit.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 4
    },
    {
      "item": "In the API Key section, click Enable.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 5,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          14
        ],
        [
          30,
          36
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Assign the following permissions to the user:",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 6
    },
    {
      "item": "View Analyzed Apps",
      "depth": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "View Reports",
      "depth": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "View Shared Apps",
      "depth": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "Change API Key",
      "depth": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "Android Analysis",
      "depth": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "iOS Analysis",
      "depth": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "GDPR Report",
      "depth": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "OWASP Report",
      "depth": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "NIAP Report",
      "depth": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "SBOM Report",
      "depth": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Save the user.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 7
    },
    {
      "item": "Generate the API Key",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "From the user settings page, you can generate an API key as a group admin. If you are not an admin:",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Log in to the Quokka platform.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "From the upper right of the page, click the account name and go to the account settings page.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "On the Security tab, click Generate New API Key or use the existing key.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          15
        ],
        [
          27,
          47
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "heading": "Configuring the Connector",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "To create the Quokka data source in the Zscaler Security Operations (SecOps) platform:"
    },
    {
      "item": "Go to Configure > Sources.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          15
        ],
        [
          18,
          25
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Create.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          12
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Search for and select the connector tile from the available data sources.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 3
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "heading": "Configuring Retrieval Filters and Specifications",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "After you create the Quokka data source, enter the Authentication information:"
    },
    {
      "item": "In the Authentication section, click Create New.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          21
        ],
        [
          37,
          47
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "The Quokka Authentication window appears.",
      "depth": 0,
      "strong": [
        [
          4,
          25
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "In the Quokka Authentication window, enter the information from the Prerequisites section.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          28
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Create.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          12
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "To learn more, see Configuring Authentications and Managing Authentications."
    },
    {
      "text": "For complete configuration instructions, see Creating Data Sources."
    }
  ]
}
